1
00:00:00,191 --> 00:00:01,931
(Amy:)See? Maybe you'll love living alone.

2
00:00:02,093 --> 00:00:04,703
(Sheldon:)I don't know. Perhaps.

3
00:00:04,863 --> 00:00:09,043
(Amy:)And if it turns out you don't...
you and I could live together.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,370
(Bernadette:)You and--
Oh, sure.

5
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:14,443
(Sheldon:)And while we're at it,
why don't we get engaged, too?

6
00:00:14,606 --> 00:00:16,516
(Sheldon:)Why don't we get a little house,
start a family?

7
00:00:16,674 --> 00:00:20,144
(Sheldon:)Enjoy our sunset years together?
Do you hear yourself, woman?

8
00:00:22,213 --> 00:00:24,783
(Amy:)-Sheldon, it was just a thought.
-No. Here's a thought.

9
00:00:24,949 --> 00:00:27,059
(Sheldon:)You're not moving in,
Leonard's not moving out,

10
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:29,388
(Sheldon:)everything stays
exactly the way it is.

11
00:00:29,554 --> 00:00:32,724
(Sheldon:)And by the way, I saw you make
this Strawberry Quik with syrup,

12
00:00:32,891 --> 00:00:35,531
and you're supposed
to use the powder!

13
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:38,501
(Amy:)-It tastes the same.
-No. The syrup tastes better,

14
00:00:38,663 --> 00:00:40,163
(Sheldon:)and I don't like it.

15
00:00:43,468 --> 00:00:46,348
This is so sweet!
You never cook for me.

16
00:00:46,504 --> 00:00:49,314
(Leonard:)Well, you cook for me
all the time and...

17
00:00:51,976 --> 00:00:54,686
(Penny:)If you don't like my cooking,
why haven't you ever said anything?

18
00:00:54,846 --> 00:00:59,026
(Leonard:)It's hard to talk
with so much heavy chewing to do.

